{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/037",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u08832",
   "en": "When he swung, she just-- she wasn't there anymore. And he fell.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08833",
   "en": "She helped him stop the bleeding, and had me call an ambulance. She told the paramedics he fell.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08834",
   "en": "Before they took him to the hospital, Mike touched Sar's arm. I thought he was going to end up on the ground again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08835",
   "en": "But he hung his head, whispered \"I'm sorry,\" and started crying.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08836",
   "en": "And she hugged him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08837",
   "en": "The Williams women are a decisive bunch, Commander. We do things when we're ready. Not before, not after.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08838",
   "en": "If he really liked her, he wouldn't be pushy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08839",
   "en": "The male pursues the female. That's their nature. In the genes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08840",
   "en": "You traveled all the way home to walk your sister to school.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08841",
   "en": "You said all of your sisters learned self-defense?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08842",
   "en": "So what did you learn?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08843",
   "en": "Why didn't you tell the police?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08844",
   "en": "Sarah couldn't have been fond of you escorting her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08845",
   "en": "Did anything happen while you were home?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08846",
   "en": "That's unbelievable. Sarah must be as good as you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08847",
   "en": "She cracked him in the face. Good.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08848",
   "en": "He... missed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08849",
   "en": "Your sister's something else. But you didn't mention your father at all. Was he on deployment?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08850",
   "en": "You were right about one thing. That wasn't interesting. And where was your father during all this?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08851",
   "en": "Where was your father during this? Wasn't your family stationed near him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08852",
   "en": "No means no.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08853",
   "en": "Boys will be boys.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08854",
   "en": "Dedicated of you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08855",
   "en": "Self-defense",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08856",
   "en": "Police",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08857",
   "en": "She must've hated that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08858",
   "en": "What happened with Mike?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08859",
   "en": "Wow.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08860",
   "en": "She hit him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08861",
   "en": "He didn't hurt her?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08862",
   "en": "Interesting story.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08863",
   "en": "That was pointless.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08864",
   "en": "Where was your father?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08865",
   "en": "They were dangerous, skipper.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08866",
   "en": "They proved that two thousand years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08867",
   "en": "Yeah, that's true. It's funny, I never really thought about that before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08868",
   "en": "That depends on whether you have a problem with people who don't believe in God.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08869",
   "en": "Are you a fanatic?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08870",
   "en": "Too bad those ruins got destroyed. I mean, they lasted thousands of years. That's impressive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08871",
   "en": "I'd be more comfortable if he didn't have access to engineering and the CIC.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08872",
   "en": "Ash, you believe in an infallible, all-knowing God with a plan for the universe. All the grief we get from the Council must be part of that. Right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08873",
   "en": "They made me look like an idiot. I stood here and preached at you, and they turned on us. Just like you said they would.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08874",
   "en": "Let's put a pin in this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08875",
   "en": "You're not wrong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08876",
   "en": "You took me too seriously.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08877",
   "en": "You were right about them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08878",
   "en": "Well now. That's a whole new spin for \"on the floor and give me twenty,\" hm?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08879",
   "en": "Tsk. What will it take to prove I'm in prime condition, skipper?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08880",
   "en": "Well, geez, Shepard. If you can't laugh after that, when will you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08881",
   "en": "Duty calls. Get up to the bridge, skipper. I've got other weapons to check out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08882",
   "en": "Hey, Shepard? Whatever happens down there, I just wanted to say...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08883",
   "en": "Would you roll your eyes if I said this is the first time in months I've felt that all's right in the galaxy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08884",
   "en": "You still sassin' me, soldier? I think you need more physical training.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08885",
   "en": "You can't ever be serious, can you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08886",
   "en": "That was wonderful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08887",
   "en": "Let's make it forty.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08888",
   "en": "You're incorrigible.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08889",
   "en": "Wait. You know what? I'm not telling you. You want to hear this, you'll just have to come back to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08890",
   "en": "I have my doubts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09ashley_DS2_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11ash_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08891",
   "en": "I never properly thanked you for saving me from the geth, Commander. If you hadn't shown up...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08892",
   "en": "This will all be over soon, Shepard. One way or another.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08893",
   "en": "Commander? Shepard? I cannot believe they did this to you. I am so sorry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08894",
   "en": "If you are here to talk about Benezia's death, you need not bother. She brought it upon herself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08895",
   "en": "I've been thinking about Saren. I actually feel a little sorry for him now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08896",
   "en": "I get the feeling you want to ask me something, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08897",
   "en": "I let my professional curiosity get the better of me. Please, forgive me. Let us talk about something else.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08898",
   "en": "Thank you, Shepard. Let's... let's just talk about something else for now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08899",
   "en": "Fair enough. What did you want to talk about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08900",
   "en": "I don't understand it. She was always outspoken about the need for the asari to become more involved in shaping galactic events.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08901",
   "en": "Tell me about yourself, Liara.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08902",
   "en": "I'd like to know more about the asari.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08903",
   "en": "Do you know why Benezia joined up with Saren?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08904",
   "en": "I'd like to talk about you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08905",
   "en": "Asari culture",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08906",
   "en": "Commander, are you coming to check up on me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08907",
   "en": "Dr. Chakwas assures me I am going to be fine. I was impressed with her knowledge of asari physiology. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08908",
   "en": "So am I.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08909",
   "en": "I know you took a chance bringing me aboard this ship. I have seen the way your crew looks at me. They do not trust me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08910",
   "en": "But I am not like Benezia. I will do whatever I can to help you stop Saren. I promise.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08911",
   "en": "It means a lot to hear you say that, Commander. Thank you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08912",
   "en": "I do not begrudge you your suspicions. I just hope in time you will come to trust me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08913",
   "en": "She was... but she was not. I prefer to remember Benezia as she used to be, before she was corrupted by Sovereign's power.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08914",
   "en": "Maybe... She was a good person once, before she was twisted by Sovereign's power. Better to remember her as she used to be.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08915",
   "en": "She was gone long before she died on Noveria. Benezia was a good person once. Before she fell under Sovereign's power.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08916",
   "en": "Part of me blames Saren for her death. Part of me wants to blame her. And part of me just misses her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08917",
   "en": "That is kind of you to say. I appreciate your concern, but I am fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08918",
   "en": "We have enough reason to stop Saren. I do not need to add revenge to the list.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08919",
   "en": "Benezia chose her path, just as I have chosen mine. I am with you until the end, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08920",
   "en": "He is trapped inside his own mind. Part of him senses his identity slowly being swallowed up by Sovereign, but he is powerless to stop it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08921",
   "en": "I know his reputation, but he was a Spectre. I think he honestly believed everything he did was for the greater good.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08922",
   "en": "I wonder how he first fell into Sovereign's trap? Did he think he could somehow stop the Reapers from returning? Or was he simply driven by a lust for power and glory?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08923",
   "en": "Yes, I suppose you are right. He may be Sovereign's victim, but he is also a threat to all life as we know it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08924",
   "en": "Yes, I suppose you're right. I should not waste sympathy on Saren. Not when there are so many others who have suffered because of him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08925",
   "en": "Let's not spend every free minute talking about Saren. It is bad enough we are chasing him across the galaxy. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08926",
   "en": "Me? I am afraid I am not very interesting, Commander. I spend most of my time on remote digs, unearthing mundane items buried in long-forgotten Prothean ruins.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08927",
   "en": "Sometimes I would run afoul of indigenous life-forms, or stumble across a small band of mercenaries or privateers. But I was always careful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08928",
   "en": "Until the geth followed me to Artemis Tau, I never found myself in any situation my biotics could not handle.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08929",
   "en": "As for the solitude, well, that is one aspect that most appealed to me. Sometimes, I just need to get away from other people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08930",
   "en": "I suppose it comes from being a Matriarch's daughter. People expected me to follow in Benezia's footsteps. They wanted me to become a leader of our people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08931",
   "en": "Matriarchs guide their followers into the future; they seek the truth of what is yet to come. Maybe that's why I became so interested in the secrets of the past.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08932",
   "en": "It sounds so foolish when I say it out loud. It sounds like I became an archaeologist simply to spite Benezia.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08933",
   "en": "Ha-ha. You share the wisdom of the Matriarch, Shepard. That is exactly what Benezia said when I told her of my decision.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08934",
   "en": "No. When I told her, she simply said, \"A daughter must rebel against her mother, Liara. It is part of the natural order.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08935",
   "en": "But there was more to it than that. I felt drawn to the past. The Protheans were these wondrous, mysterious figures. I wanted to know everything about them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08936",
   "en": "That is why I find you so fascinating. You were marked by the beacon on Eden Prime; you were touched by working Prothean technology!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08937",
   "en": "I love my work. Seeking out history's lost secrets has a special appeal for me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08938",
   "en": "On occasion, I have run afoul of indigenous life-forms, or stumbled across small bands of privateers. That probably does not seem very exciting to someone like you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08939",
   "en": "I guess seeking out history's lost secrets holds a special appeal for me. I would give a century of my life to discover a beacon like the one you found on Eden Prime.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08940",
   "en": " You were actually touched by working Prothean technology! That is why I find you so fascinating, Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08941",
   "en": "I only meant that you would be an interesting specimen for in-depth study. No-- that's even worse!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08942",
   "en": "Now you know why I prefer to spend my time in the field with data disks and computers. I always seem to say something embarrassing around other people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08943",
   "en": "Please... just pretend this conversation never happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08944",
   "en": "I-- I am sorry, Commander. I did not mean it like that. I just... I am used to dealing with computers and data disks. I am not very good with people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08945",
   "en": "You look much better. How are you feeling?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08946",
   "en": "You're in good hands. Dr. Chakwas knows what she's doing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08947",
   "en": "Alliance medical personnel take courses in alien biology, just in case.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08948",
   "en": "I'm just glad we got there in time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08949",
   "en": "I had to save you. You can help me stop Saren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08950",
   "en": "Don't worry, Liara. I trust you. I know you won't let me down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08951",
   "en": "Promises are easy to make, but hard to keep.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08952",
   "en": "Don't pretend it doesn't bother you. She was your mother.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08953",
   "en": "In the end, maybe she's better off now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08954",
   "en": "She's gone. You can't change that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08955",
   "en": "The best of your mother lives on in you: her determination, her intelligence, her strength.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08956",
   "en": "I blame Saren. And if I were you, I'd want revenge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08957",
   "en": "He's become a slave to the Reapers and he can't even see it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08958",
   "en": "He's the last person I'd feel sorry for.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08959",
   "en": "He's no innocent victim. He was a ruthless bastard long before he fell under Sovereign's control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08960",
   "en": "Whatever Saren's reasons may have been, they're long gone now. He has to be stopped.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08961",
   "en": "There's nothing noble about Saren or what he did. He got exactly what he deserved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08962",
   "en": "Sounds dangerous. And lonely.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08963",
   "en": "You don't like other people?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08964",
   "en": "All children rebel against their parents. It's a natural part of growing up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08965",
   "en": "I bet that pissed her off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08966",
   "en": "That doesn't sound very interesting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08967",
   "en": "You must enjoy something about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08968",
   "en": "You're right, that doesn't sound very interesting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08969",
   "en": "Sounds like you want to dissect me in a lab somewhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerl_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_08liara_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09liara_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u08970",
   "en": "Calm down, Liara. I was only joking.",
